  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-5708195-A", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "furthermore, via the communication unit 36, the leak information accumulator 82 accumulates the actual leak location and leak quantity obtained as a result of inspection and transmitted from the worker 40 who went to the actual spot, in the same way as the case other than earthquakes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102664616-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, when the corrugated pipe body according to the present invention is composed of a unit corrugated pipe, it can provide excellent earthquake resistance, water leak prevention, shock absorption, and ease of maintenance compared to the existing corrugated pipe body"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102664616-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the underground drain pipe connection unit according to the present invention can improve earthquake resistance and water leak prevention performance, providing a safe and comfortable living environment"}, {"pat_id": "US-5708195-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the leak detector of the managing center includes a seismometer for sensing occurrence of an earthquake and generating a signal"}, {"pat_id": "US-5708195-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at the time of occurrence of an earthquake, a seismometer of the leak detector generates a signal"}, {"pat_id": "US-5708195-A", "para_id": "para_13", "text": "10 shows the operation flow of the leak detector 26 at the time of occurrence of an earthquake"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100603985-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, in the above method, as the manhole and the conveying pipe are fixedly installed by mortar, the mortar part is partially removed or cracks are leaked due to the crustal fluctuation such as a weak earthquake and the fatigue load caused by the vibration caused by the flow velocity"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102664616-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "manhole in complex with underground drain pipe connection unit for earthquake resistance and water leak prevention the present invention relates to a manhole in a complex having an underground drain pipe connection unit for earthquake resistance and water leak prevention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102664616-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the purpose is to provide a manhole in the complex with an underground drain pipe connection unit for earthquake resistance and water leak prevention, which can prevent twists or water leaks from occurring at connection points to the outside"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102664616-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "figure 2 is a diagram showing a manhole in a complex with an underground drain pipe connection unit for earthquake resistance and water leak prevention according to the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "US-5708195-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in other words, the first conventional technique is premised on the existence of water leak and lacks the viewpoint that pipeline breakage should be sensed rapidly at the time of a disaster such as an earthquake"}, {"pat_id": "US-11905688-B2", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "these movement sensors detect both movement and acceleration, which allows detection of earthquakes or other events that might correspond to a higher probability of a leak forming"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3906965-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "furthermore, if the aquarium itself is aged, the tank wall made of concrete may crack due to earthquakes and leak water"}]</data>
</edge>
