n support some degree of external deformation such as heat deformation or earthquake due to temperature difference"}, {"pat_id": "EP-3706066-B1", "para_id": "para_16", "text": "in another embodiment, not covered by the claimed invention, moreover the pressure sensor comprises another bragg grating, installed on a part of said sensor not deforming after pressure, such for example a cylindrical body, so that it is subject only to deformation due to temperature"}, {"pat_id": "EP-3706066-B1", "para_id": "para_18", "text": "preferably, in addition the pressure sensor comprises another bragg grating, installed on a part of said sensor not deforming after liquid flow, so that it is subject only to deformation due to temperature"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101044701-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, there is an urgent need to introduce a structure that can effectively absorb such heat deformation to protect the gravity wet oxidation reactor.the present invention created to solve the above problems is to protect the gravity wet oxidation reactor by effectively absorbing the heat deformation according to the temperature inside the gravity pressure vessel"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101967405-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "therefore, if a point sensor is used to measure the temperature and strain in the water pipe, it is not possible to confirm the position of the sensor even if leakage or deformation occurs in the interval between the sensors"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100315762-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the present invention, the composite panel 10 can be firmly assembled by fitting the composite panel 10 to the skeleton constituting each component panel of the large tank, so that the connection part of the composite panel 10 is caused by internal deformation pressure due to bending deformation or temperature change"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100988365-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the concrete tank exhibits deformation due to temperature deterioration, the cracks may occur in the panel adhesive composition of the concrete tank, resulting in a decrease in waterproofness and separation of the panel and the adhesive composition"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102733651-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "this structure adopts the advantages of a wedge gate valve (413) and a parallel gate valve (416), and is relatively less affected by deformation due to temperature and pressure"}, {"pat_id": "US-11318396-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "due to the thermal conductivity of the exterior cover, both the interior woven or non-woven panel and the interior surfaces of the pressure vessel are theoretically capable of reaching temperatures in excess of the deformation temperature of 304 stainless steel"}]</data>
