0 of the present invention is recovered, the amount corresponding to the purification treatment water by the water level detection means and the control unit 600"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200314265-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as such, by automatically controlling the driving speed of the lifting motor 26 in several stages according to the water level of the water channel 10, water flows in the water channel 10 so that the contaminants 40 can be quickly removed when the water level suddenly blows in rainy weather"}]</data>
