  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101837300-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the water level control valve includes a cylindrical body through which the water level control valve is vertically passed, and a buoyant body for selectively shielding the first flow path and the second flow path while moving up and down the body"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention, a pipeline is installed between the shielding facility of the marine waste treatment plant and the land storage tank, and the polluted water of the shielding facility is transported to the land storage tank by the pipeline, thereby reducing the water level in the shielding facility of the marine waste treatment plant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and a control unit for controlling driving of the pressurization pressurizing pump to transport the contaminated water to the land storage tank when the internal water level of the shielding facility is higher than a predetermined reference value, and the inside water level of the shielding facility can be adjusted by being transported in both directions between the storage tank and the polluted water storage tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the control unit 180 controls the driving of the pressurization pressurizing pump 170 to bypass the contaminated water to the land storage tank 140 when the internal water level of the shielding facility 110 is higher than a predetermined reference value"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "the water level is lowered by the water purifying treatment facility 120 by the water purifying treatment facility 120 while the water level of the shielding facility 110 is higher than a preset reference value, onshore reservoir 140, which in case of difficulty"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and a control unit for controlling driving of the pressurization pressurizing pump to transport the contaminated water to the land storage tank when the internal water level of the shielding facility is higher than a predetermined reference value, and the inside water level of the shielding facility can be adjusted by being transported in both directions between the storage tank and the polluted water storage tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention, a pipeline is installed between the shielding facility of the marine waste treatment plant and the land storage tank, and the polluted water of the shielding facility is transported to the land storage tank by the pipeline, thereby reducing the water level in the shielding facility of the marine waste treatment plant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the control unit 180 controls the driving of the pressurization pressurizing pump 170 to bypass the contaminated water to the land storage tank 140 when the internal water level of the shielding facility 110 is higher than a predetermined reference value"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101875497-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "for example, in the case of the domestic west coast, the polluted water is transported to the land-based storage tank 140 through the polluted water storage tank 130, thereby indicating that the internal water level of the shielding facility 110 can be lowered"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101541589-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "wherein the indirect water intake accommodated in the water collection is disposed inside the air intake and the air intake, prevent catalyst while floating on the surface of the water intake indirect include shielding for lifting in accordance with the water level"}]</data>
