r flows backwards due to a blockage of an underground drainage pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200303595-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "drainpipe anti-closed device of manhole the present invention relates to a manhole drainage blockage preventing device to collect the rainwater or sewage, and to prevent foreign substances from entering the clogged drainage pipe of the manhole discharged to the sewer pipe connected to the sewage treatment plant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200303595-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention relates to a manhole drainage blockage preventing device which can prevent the drainage pipe from being clogged due to the inflow of foreign substances as the container is drawn out and collected"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200303595-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "hereinafter, the operation of the drainage pipe blockage preventing device of the manhole according to an embodiment of the present invention will be described in more detail with reference to the accompanying drawings"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102838013-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "and the sewage inlet (12), and is a manhole that can control the inflow and blockage of rain or sewage while allowing the smooth inflow of sewage without foreign substances such as fallen leaves"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200303595-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as shown in figure 2 to 4, the manhole drain pipe blockage preventing device according to an embodiment of the present invention, the outer tube 20 (outer) through which the inlet of the drain pipe 10 is formed to project through the bottom surface (outer) case) and a boss (30g)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100784989-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in treating rainwater containing a large amount of turbidity, a blockage due to a large amount of turbidity may occur in the chamber portion 210 of the vortex valve, so that an outflow downstream from the rainwater discharge portion 130 of the manhole body may occur"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102838013-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text"