  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101202895-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "meanwhile, the septic tank 30 has a series of decaying tanks 31, filtration tanks 32, an oxidizing tank 33, and a disinfection tank 34 so that the initial rainwater introduced into the stormwater chamber 210 can be sequentially purified"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100752792-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "subsequently, the amount of rainwater transferred to the flow regulating tank 3 is controlled to increase rapidly, and a certain amount of air is supplied through an diffuser installed at the bottom of the flow regulating tank 3 to prevent sedimentation and decay of the sludge"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101382006-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the remaining rainwater is decayed to prevent the occurrence of odors or pests, and periodically operates the air diffuser to remove contaminants attached to the filtration device or the swash plate device"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100878507-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in other words, there is a structure that prevents the leakage of odor due to decay as a part of the drainage water flowing in the drainage pipe is stagnant like the drainage in the drainage port, and the drainage is drained to the drainage safety net by cleaning and bathing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100878507-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in other words, there is a structure that prevents the leakage of odor due to decay as a part of the drainage water flowing in the drainage pipe is stagnant like the drainage in the drainage port, and the drainage is drained to the drainage safety net by cleaning and bathing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100612249-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, this precipitation method is difficult to neutralize the acid rain, and the quality of the stored rainwater is worse because the decay begins when the particles are small or floating contaminants or microorganisms mixed in the rainwater into the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101313936-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "naturally, the lower spigot 208 interlocked with the float opens, and after a certain period of time, the rainwater stored in the initial excellent tank is completely discharged to prevent decay due to the residue and to prepare for the next rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100955909-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, in order to solve the problem that the contaminants accumulated in the inflow tank decay and cause odor after the rainfall is over, the hole is drilled at the bottom of the inflow tank, and gravel or porous media is installed outside to filter the contaminants"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100985170-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, in order to solve the problem that the contaminants accumulated in the inflow tank decay and cause odor after the rainfall is over, the hole is drilled at the bottom of the inflow tank, and gravel or porous media is installed outside to filter the contaminants"}]</data>
