ch member"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100819522-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "seating groove having a bottom surface of the form is formed, the upper edge of the suction pipe seating member is characterized in that the water supply member is further provided to prevent the leakage of rainwater between the bottom plate and the suction pipe seating member bottom of the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100819522-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the upper end of the lower connection block (50a), similar to the above-described connection block 50, the general rubber material so as to prevent the leakage of rainwater stored in the reservoir (1a) of a vertical closed structure through the weight of each member alternatively, an index member 53 made of a synthetic resin material is installed, and the sealing member 53 is formed between the connection block 50 and the lowermost connection block 50a by the index member 53 installed as described above"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101326602-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "by opening a large amount of rainwater into the reservoir quickly and allowing it to be discharged into the drain, it is possible to respond quickly to the rainy weather conditions of the road, and also to prevent leakage of odors from the underground drainage to the outside and the introduction of foreign substances into the drain can be controlled"}, {"pat_id": "US-9709431-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in this example, if the rain sensor indicates that there is no local precipitation, but that there are water levels above a threshold, the control system 100 may track property operations to determine if there is a problematic operation that may be causing water leakage within the property"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100792022-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "seating groove having a bottom surface of the form is formed, the upper edge of the suction pipe seating member is characterized in that the water supply member is further provided to prevent the leakage of rai