, {"pat_id": "KR-102041291-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in order to solve this problem, a number of techniques have been disclosed for preventing leakage of odor flowing back from the sewage pipe back to the rainwater pipe or rainwater collection tank, for example, to cover oil and access holes of the rainwater collection tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102041291-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, only the mechanical devices installed in rainwater pipes or storm water collection tanks do not completely prevent leakage of odors flowing back from the sewage pipes, and as a result, odor leaks around sewage pipes or storm water collection tanks, causing discomfort to passers-by"}]</data>
