 to respond quickly to the rainy weather conditions of the road, and also to prevent leakage of odors from the underground drainage to the outside and the introduction of foreign substances into the drain can be controlled"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100792022-B1", "para_id": "claim_12", "text": "a seating groove having an arc-shaped bottom surface is formed, and an upper end edge of the suction pipe seating member is further provided with an index member to prevent leakage of rainwater between the bottom plate, which is the bottom surface of the reservoir, and the suction pipe seating member"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100792022-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "seating groove having a bottom surface of the form is formed, the upper edge of the suction pipe seating member is characterized in that the water supply member is further provided to prevent the leakage of rainwater between the bottom plate and the suction pipe seating member bottom of the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100819522-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "seating groove having a bottom surface of the form is formed, the upper edge of the suction pipe seating member is characterized in that the water supply member is further provided to prevent the leakage of rainwater between the bottom plate and the suction pipe seating member bottom of the reservoir"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100702860-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, in the case of the outer wall block (10, 10a) the inner wall of the storage tank (1) to achieve the outer wall of the storage tank (1) while smoothly flowing with the prevention of leakage of rainwater moved from each storage block (20)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100751233-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and the second purification tank (11) is provided with a u-trap (t) so that rainwater can be introduced while preventing the leakage of ammonia gas, thereby fully utilizing the water resources"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100792022-B1", "para_id": "claim_8", "text": "wherein the upper and lower ends of the connec