 {"pat_id": "KR-200177676-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when freezing and raining due to the rainy season or weather changes in summer, rainwater has been introduced into the water meter protection tank, which has been a cause of oxidation and corrosion of the water meter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200163545-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention was devised to solve the above problems, and prevents foreign matters and rainwater from accumulating around the valve tube, and facilitates the installation and dismantling of the drinking water and prevents freezing"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297956-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, in order to sufficiently prevent freezing of the water meter, a method capable of blocking the inflow of moisture, groundwater, rainwater, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297956-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "by means of the above solution, the present invention protects the water meter from physical factors such as external environment or impact and at the same time blocks the inflow of moisture, groundwater, rainwater, etc., thereby sufficiently preventing freezing of the water meter in winter"}]</data>
