eby increasing the thermal insulation power to prevent the freezing of the water meter, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100454430-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and the lid (5) is in close contact with outside snow and non-cold wind can not flow into the water meter protection tank (1), thereby increasing the thermal insulation power to prevent the freezing of the water meter, etc"}]</data>
