  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101899332-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "accordingly, the filtration chamber 100 can store the used water film without losing it to the outside, thereby preventing problems such as reuse or ground subsidence due to underground water leakage due to groundwater leakage in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100649139-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, in the coupling method using the flanges 11 and 31, there is a high possibility that leakage occurs at the coupling site due to ground subsidence or vibration at the coupling site, and in order to prevent this, it is best to fix it by welding"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100926947-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when the coupling of the coupling device is loose due to ground subsidence or vibration, there is a high risk of water leakage into the gap between the water supply pipe and the connection pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200436180-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the present invention was devised to solve the above problems, and even if the water well or the pipe is distorted due to ground subsidence and external impact, the watertight coupling state is maintained to completely prevent the occurrence of leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100465921-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "so as to be assembled in the formwork (1), so as to be firmly integrated with the reinforced concrete fume pipe (7), as in the prior art, the drainage pipe 4 embedded in the ground 8 the invention provides robustness and prevention of leakage due to ground subsidence even under prolonged use or in adverse conditions such as rainy season and heavy rain"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100528609-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "to be firmly integrated with the reinforcing drainage pipe (7) it is an invention that provides the robustness and prevention of leakage due to ground subsidence even in bad conditions such as long-term use or rainy season, heavy rain by filling the drainage pipe buried in the drainage pipe"