  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101899332-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "accordingly, the filtration chamber 100 can store the used water film without losing it to the outside, thereby preventing problems such as reuse or ground subsidence due to underground water leakage due to groundwater leakage in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102443623-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, since the prefabricated culvert of the present invention is coupled in a structure in which the coupling protrusion of the front connection part and the coupling groove of the rear connection part are engaged, it is possible to suppress the opening of the connection part during subsidence of the ground as much as possible, thereby preventing water leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102443623-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, since the prefabricated culvert of the present invention is coupled in a structure in which the coupling protrusion of the front connection part and the coupling groove of the rear connection part are engaged, it is possible to suppress the opening of the connection part during subsidence of the ground as much as possible, thereby preventing water leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100540454-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it solves the uneven condition of the drainage pipes that are buried in the ground and solves the problems that may occur due to the subsidence of the ground in the soft ground, and sometimes reinforces it to prevent the leakage of the connection part by twisting the drainage pipe due to the depression of the ground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100540454-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it solves the uneven condition of the drainage pipes that are buried in the ground and solves the problems that may occur due to the subsidence of the ground in the soft ground, and sometimes reinforces it to prevent the leakage of the connection part by twisting the drainage pipe due to the depression of the ground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102380491-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the above-mentioned joint method, the joint method using the color ring is not used for sewage pipes including rainwater pipes because it is difficult to fill the mortar and there is a concern about groundwater contamination and subsidence due to leakage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102381194-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "prefabricated manhole structure for sewagethe present invention relates to a prefabricated manhole structure for sewerage, and more particularly, to prevent separation from external shock and subsidence of the ground when a vertical sphere is seated and coupled to a lower sphere, and to block sewage leakage"}, {"pat_id": "US-11473713-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "subsidence is mainly because that the dislocation of the pipe joints or loss of foundation supporting materials caused by the fluid leakage at the cracks of the pipelines can result in the void, thus the subsidence occurs under the action of the upper load"}]</data>
