  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "US-4457646-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this has increasingly resulted in basement flooding, backing up of sewer drains and extensive damage, produced by flooding, to building substructures, foundations and basements"}, {"pat_id": "US-4457646-A", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in this way, a condition of flooding in which the pressure in line 301 could build up (with consequent risk otherwise of basement flooding or backing up of drains, etc.) will instead cause diversion of the excess water into reservoir 323"}, {"pat_id": "US-6270661-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "if this happens, especially in cases where the groundsoil provides less than ideal drainage, it can lead to incomplete or improper treatment of the water, backing up, flooding, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101923707-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention also provides a device for continuously removing foreign matter flowing into a drainage channel together with rainwater, thereby preventing a flooding caused by blocking the drainage port with foreign matter"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102838013-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, especially in the rainy season or in the fall, foreign substances such as fallen leaves can block the inlet, making it difficult to drain, which can easily lead to flooding and human casualties"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102599308-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "in cases where the drainage function is lost due to blockage by various foreign substances, rainwater whose water level rises due to poor drainage treatment can be safely bypassed and treated to prevent flooding damage due to rainfall"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100937200-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, in the case of the levee structure, water can be simply discharged to the other side of the levee to prevent the collapse and flooding of the levee, but in the case of the float floating on the water source, a net is generally formed at one end of the drain pipe to prevent the inflow of the levee"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200446316-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "sewage should be supplied with household sewage from homes or commercial buildings near sewer pipes, and rainwater quickly drains rainwater generated during rainfall or snowfall to prevent road flooding and to prevent contamination from rainwater splashing"}, {"pat_id": "US-11298635-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "alternative structures, for example, chambers filled with porous media and underdrains, can be cost prohibitive and may fail resulting in flooding the rain garden with debris, which requires extensive clean-up"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "second, through the drainage module and the flood control module, it is possible to quickly and actively respond to flooding in the event of a water leak"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the installation height of the flood detection sensor 210 is installed at a certain height from the bottom of the drain 101, not the bottom of the drain 101, so that it can be determined that flooding has occurred due to water leakage, not living water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the installation height of the flood detection sensor 210 is installed at a certain height from the bottom of the drain 101, not the bottom of the drain 101, so that it can be determined that flooding has occurred due to water leakage, not living water"}, {"pat_id": "US-7802587-B1", "para_id": "para_27", "text": "with valve 10 closed no further water will be permitted to pass from drain pipe 53 into sump pit 50, thereby preventing basement 61 from flooding"}, {"pat_id": "US-8691091-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the rapid air escape may also cause the filter media to jump vertically inside the filter tank, causing it to be lost through the drain line and possibly causing plugging of the drain and flooding"}]</data>
