er agent 493 the drainage of the rainwater can be smoothly performed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200357071-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "road drainage with first flush treatment ability the present invention is to insert a filter filling tank having a filtration treatment function in the conventional rainwater receiver to the road surface drainage treatment device having an initial excellent treatment function that can reliably remove and treat contaminants contained in the road surface drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102141002-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text": "therefore, by the rainwater collecting well 10 of the present invention, the initial rainwater is discharged through the drain pipe 11, and the rainwater having a low degree of contamination can be discharged through the collecting pipe 16 to store more clean rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101163609-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when debris is caught in the hinge shaft, which is the driving part, or the material changes such as corrosion as the seal elapses, the deodorizing function is lost, and the deodorizing plate is not opened properly in rainy weather, and thus the rainwater is not drained smoothly"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102805058-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the cover opens when rainwater flows in and closes when the rainwater inlet is blocked, thereby solving the problem of various wastes flowing in together with rainwater easily clogging the drains, while the generation of a bad smell due to the decay of the waste is unavoidable"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101218770-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the support portion 10 is preferably installed in the sewer 110 to drain the rainwater and is formed of a rust-free metal material such as stainless steel that does not easily cause bending deformation due to external force"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101056650-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "here, the drain valve 158 is frequently opened to remove foreign substances when the rainwater reservoir tank 150 is cleaned