  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-200344163-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "that is, in the above-described construction method, since the water supply and drainage pipes are long connected in one direction, the bearing capacity for the transverse pressure is extremely weak, and even a slight ground subsidence of the water supply and drainage pipe buried site may easily cause the breakage and gaps of the water supply and drainage pipe to be bent or twisted"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100540454-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it solves the uneven condition of the drainage pipes that are buried in the ground and solves the problems that may occur due to the subsidence of the ground in the soft ground, and sometimes reinforces it to prevent the leakage of the connection part by twisting the drainage pipe due to the depression of the ground"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100540454-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it solves the uneven condition of the drainage pipes that are buried in the ground and solves the problems that may occur due to the subsidence of the ground in the soft ground, and sometimes reinforces it to prevent the leakage of the connection part by twisting the drainage pipe due to the depression of the ground"}]</data>
