  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-102200449-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, due to the formation of communication between the drainage channel and the atmosphere, relatively small foreign substances such as cigarette butts and fallen leaves are introduced, causing the drainage channel to become dirty or block the drainage channel due to the introduced foreign material"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102200449-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as a result, it is possible to block in advance that the waste remaining without being sucked penetrates into the drainage channel along with rainwater, etc., ultimately contaminating the sewage treatment plant, and thus, it is possible to delete the pollutant removal work of the sewage treatment plant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102242448-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the cover that is connected to the upper surface of the crossbar of the grating partition is fixedly assembled with a shaft pin penetrating in the horizontal direction.drainage capacity is limited because the drainage block has a single drainage channel, and it is related to the amount of water in the structure of a single drainage channel"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102253598-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the cover that is coupled to the upper surface of the crossbar of the grating partition is fixedly assembled with a shaft pin penetrating in the horizontal direction.drainage capacity is limited because the drainage block has a single drainage channel"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200378213-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as a means for preventing the blockage and odor of the sewer connected to the end of the drainage channel, a odor prevention cup is installed in the sewer connected to the end of the drainage to shield odors coming up through the drainage and filter filth introduced through the drainage"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200151725-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the upper part of the drainage channel was reveted to prevent vehicle accidents and blockage of the 