lled to prevent the precipitation of inorganic materials, and supercritical heat exchangers and quenching mixers are installed to prevent corrosion of the treated water and precipitation of inorganic materials"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100625882-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "supercritical heat exchanger to recover in the supercritical water with little corrosion, and to install the quenching mixture to prevent corrosion and precipitation of inorganic substances in the cooling process of the treated water to secure the stability and continuous operation of the supercritical water oxidation process it was"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100625882-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "in addition, by improving the supercritical water oxidation process, which consumes a large amount of energy to prevent the precipitation of inorganic substances, supercritical heat exchanger and quenching mixer are installed to prevent corrosion of the treated water and precipitation of inorganic substances and to save energy"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100625882-B1", "para_id": "para_10", "text": "it is effective in preventing clogging caused by corrosion, and supercritical water oxidation process, which consumes a large amount of energy, is installed to prevent the precipitation of inorganic materials, and supercritical heat exchangers and quenching mixers are installed to prevent corrosion of the treated water and precipitation of inorganic materials"}]</data>
