  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100614939-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention, by installing a buoyancy blocking device 130 is operated by buoyancy during the sewage backflow on the bottom surface of the rainwater inlet 113 of the manhole 110 to block the inlet 113, the rainwater from the original while performing the function of, the guerrilla torrential rain, flooding due to the backflow of sewage due to the flood effect is to be prevented in advance"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100654756-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in order to prevent the sewage flow back to the upper side of the water collecting manhole during rainy or rainy season, the drainage 42 of the fixing plate 40 is blocked so that all of the drainage holes 42 of the fixing plate 40 are prevented from flooding the road"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102678778-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "manhole block manhole block the present invention relates to a manhole block, and more specifically, is manufactured by mixing recycled aggregate (recycled aggregate) and concrete in a certain ratio to provide sufficient strength as well as eco-friendliness through efficient use of resources, as well as internal flooding due to rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102678778-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "because the manhole cover is structurally exposed to the ground of the road or sidewalk, especially when it rains heavily, there is a risk of rainwater flowing into the manhole block and internal flooding, no matter how airtight the sealing treatment is"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200328169-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, when the sewage flows back due to rainy season or flooding, the separation of the menhole cover 2 from the support frame 12 is expected by the blocking plate 8 blocking the through hole 10 of the manhole cover 2"}, {"pat_id": "US-11994422-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in some embodiments, the incidents and the potential incidents may include, but not limited to, blockages or flooding in the