  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-100720157-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "still another object of the present invention is to provide a odor prevention manhole that can catch filth flowing into the manhole, thereby blocking the source of odor, and preventing clogging of the drain hole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100913911-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "multifunction offensive odor remover the present invention relates to a multi-functional odor removing device that prevents inflow of rainwater and sewage into the sewer of low-lying houses as well as odor blocking of the manhole, and more particularly, the lower shielding plate having a function of removing odors"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101054283-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the drain pipe is prevented from being blocked by the foreign matter deposited on the bottom of the manhole, thereby making it possible to smoothly drain the water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102046693-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the odor blocking device 100 of the manhole according to the present invention can be used in different types of rain gutter holes"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200338729-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "on the other hand, if more than a certain amount of sediment accumulated in the bottom of the manhole, the movement of wastewater is blocked, so that smooth drainage is not achieved, and should be removed on a regular basis"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200416889-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, the rainwater and sewage that did not flow into the upper portion of the trench cover 31 are diverted to the manhole 20 through the boundary block, so that the rainwater and sewage that do not flow through the trench cover 31 flow into other adjacent areas"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100784989-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in treating rainwater containing a large amount of turbidity, a blockage due to a large amount of turbidity may occur in the chamber portion 210 of the vortex valve, so that an outflow downstream from the rainwater discharge portion 130 of the manhole body may occur"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102838013-B1", "para_id": "claim_2", "text": "and the sewage inlet (12), and is a manhole that can control the inflow and blockage of rain or sewage while allowing the smooth inflow of sewage without foreign substances such as fallen leaves"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102838013-B1", "para_id": "claim_6", "text": "through which foreign substances such as fallen leaves sliding between the protrusions (31) can gather, which is a manhole capable of controlling the inflow and blockage of rain or sewage while allowing the smooth inflow of sewage from foreign substances such as fallen leaves"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102838013-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "figures 3a to 3c are perspective views sequentially showing the operating state of the grating part of a manhole that can control the inflow and blockage of rain or sewage according to the present invention while allowing the smooth inflow of sewage from foreign substances such as fallen leaves"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102838013-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention relates to a manhole that can discharge rain or various types of sewage, etc., into a sewage treatment plant or the like on the ground (1), and is mainly composed of a main body (10), a grating portion (20), a blockage prevention means (30), and a fall prevention portion (40)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200303595-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "drainpipe anti-closed device of manhole the present invention relates to a manhole drainage blockage preventing device to collect the rainwater or sewage, and to prevent foreign substances from entering the clogged drainage pipe of the manhole discharged to the sewer pipe connected to the sewage treatment plant"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200303595-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention relates to a manhole drainage blockage preventing device which can prevent the drainage pipe from being clogged due to the inflow of foreign substances as the container is drawn out and collected"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200303595-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as shown in figure 2 to 4, the manhole drain pipe blockage preventing device according to an embodiment of the present invention, the outer tube 20 (outer) through which the inlet of the drain pipe 10 is formed to project through the bottom surface (outer) case) and a boss (30g)"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200303595-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "hereinafter, the operation of the drainage pipe blockage preventing device of the manhole according to an embodiment of the present invention will be described in more detail with reference to the accompanying drawings"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200303595-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as described above, the manhole drainage blockage preventing device according to the present invention has the following advantages"}, {"pat_id": "US-11008747-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "however, as with conventional separate sewer manholes, it should be understood that in exceptional use, such as during heavy rain, flooding and/or blockage, the first chamber may be in liquid communication with the second chamber via the first access port and/or the second access port"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100804203-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this intrusion is caused by indirect intrusion caused by various kinds of piping failures such as pipe breakage and poor connection at the pipe connection due to the aging of the sewer trunk 301 and the sewer pipe 302, and through the manhole cover and the domestic drainage facility"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101156757-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the double manhole cover was prevented from being separated and the breakage of the manhole, but this is because the size of the drainage opening is large, and when strong water pressure is applied, the double manhole cover can not be prevented from being broken and the breakage of the manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101219791-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the non-point contaminant purification device using the purification unit according to the present invention effectively removes foreign substances piggybacked in rainwater treated in the manhole by using the purification unit, and removes a first porous separator between the first ceramic module and the first soil layer of the purification unit"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101384724-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "according to the present invention, during rain, the initial rainwater containing non-point pollutants introduced into the manhole can be drained to the sewage treatment plant through sewage pipes to reduce the contamination of the rivers by the non-point pollutants as well as inflow after the initial rainwater"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102387766-B1", "para_id": "para_5", "text": "corresponding to the manhole, it is easy to install and easy to install, and it is possible to significantly reduce the cost of equipment, and to prevent contamination of the surroundings due to odor while maintaining the drainage function of the manhole itself"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200300524-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it can be inserted and inserted into the body to provide a pipe connection structure with a simple structure, and furthermore, it is possible to prevent soil contamination due to leakage of rainwater through securing watertightness, as well as to reduce the time and cost required for the reconstruction of the manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101181863-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "here, the high-pressure injector 50 is installed in an airtight space that does not penetrate rainwater so as to be easy to maintain and prevent corrosion by rainwater through a manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200372189-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the case of no rain water, the cover plate is brought into close contact with the lower part of the manhole cover net, and the odor inside the manhole is prevented from being released to the outside through the structure in which the cover sheet for preventing corrosion is thermally bonded to the cover plate"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200203779-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "socket for connecting drainpipes the present invention relates to a drain pipe connecting socket that can be firmly endured from external impact while maintaining the watertightness when connecting the branch drain pipe from the manhole to the main drain pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200300524-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it can be inserted and inserted into the body to provide a pipe connection structure with a simple structure, and furthermore, it is possible to prevent soil contamination due to leakage of rainwater through securing watertightness, as well as to reduce the time and cost required for the reconstruction of the manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101530519-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "accordingly, when the water flows into the manhole due to the phenomenon of the inflow of external water into rain, the occurrence of water leakage from the multi-purpose pipe m, or the condensation phenomenon, the water can be led to the hopper 34"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200300524-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it can be inserted and inserted into the body to provide a pipe connection structure with a simple structure, and furthermore, it is possible to prevent soil contamination due to leakage of rainwater through securing watertightness, as well as to reduce the time and cost required for the reconstruction of the manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200403422-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "more specifically, by artificially opening and closing the drain hole formed in the manhole cover by opening the drain hole in the rainy season when you want to discharge the sewage or rain, and smoothly discharged sewage or rain water, and closed in the dry season by preventing the leakage of flies, mosquitoes and other harmful insects, and to prevent odors to achieve a more pleasant environment free of odors and pests"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200449230-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "more specifically, the present invention relates to a safety manhole cover for preventing rainwater trapping with a catch preventing part and a slope to prevent safety accidents due to rainwater swelling and rainwater leakage during rainy weather and to prevent accidents caused by footing when a pedestrian is walking"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200449230-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "there was a problem that causes an electric shock accident.in order to solve these problems, the present invention prevents safety accidents due to rainwater swelling and rainwater leakage in rainy weather, and safety manholes for preventing rainwater swelling with a catch preventing part and an inclined part to prevent accidents caused by footfalls when pedestrians walk"}, {"pat_id": "JP-4637561-B2", "para_id": "para_9", "text": "in addition, the inner lid is equipped with a pressure relief mechanism and a rainwater dropping mechanism, so that it is hardly affected by water increase during abnormal rainfall such as typhoons, and therefore damage due to lifting of the manhole cover is prevented"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100420101-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "a flow control valve having an integrally coaxially connected valve body capable of lifting up and down is accommodated inside the manhole cylinder, and the float rises due to a rise in the level of the rainwater introduced through the upper rainwater inlet pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100681956-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when the amount of sewage contaminated in the sewage inflow space increases, the contaminated sewage is prevented from flowing back to the rainwater inflow space through the lifting floating means provided in the manhole"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100913911-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "multifunction offensive odor remover the present invention relates to a multi-functional odor removing device that prevents inflow of rainwater and sewage into the sewer of low-lying houses as well as odor blocking of the manhole, and more particularly, the lower shielding plate having a function of removing odors"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200449230-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "more specifically, the present invention relates to a safety manhole cover for preventing rainwater trapping with a catch preventing part and a slope to prevent safety accidents due to rainwater swelling and rainwater leakage during rainy weather and to prevent accidents caused by footing when a pedestrian is walking"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200449230-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "there was a problem that causes an electric shock accident.in order to solve these problems, the present invention prevents safety accidents due to rainwater swelling and rainwater leakage in rainy weather, and safety manholes for preventing rainwater swelling with a catch preventing part and an inclined part to prevent accidents caused by footfalls when pedestrians walk"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101384724-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "it further comprises a plurality of penetration guide member 160 is filled so as to form a void around the manhole 110 in order to penetrate into the ground while temporarily storing the rain water passing through the filter unit 140"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100633532-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in rainy weather with heavy rainfall, rainwater and sewage flowing through the rainwater and sewage inlets 23 of the manhole 10 increase, and the wear 40 formed inside the manhole 10 by the flow rate of the rainwater and sewage increased"}]</data>
