-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "this invention has the effect of preventing malfunction or performance degradation due to flooding of various sensors or moisture exposed for a long time by forming an air pocket"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the installation height of the flood detection sensor 210 is installed at a certain height from the bottom of the drain 101, not the bottom of the drain 101, so that it can be determined that flooding has occurred due to water leakage, not living water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102306868-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the installation height of the flood detection sensor 210 is installed at a certain height from the bottom of the drain 101, not the bottom of the drain 101, so that it can be determined that flooding has occurred due to water leakage, not living water"}]</data>
