  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101500632-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the present embodiment, predetermined seismic load is selected in consideration of the material and the capacity of the water tank 5, and for example, when the vibration energy of water is added to the predetermined earthquake load by an earthquake load, it can be determined by the strength of an earthquake that may cause deformation, breakage, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100653866-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the present invention thus achieved by forming a storage tank using a plurality of tubes, first, the construction is simple and quick, and there is no cracking caused by uneven settlement or earthquake"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101500632-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the present embodiment, predetermined seismic load is selected in consideration of the material and the capacity of the water tank 5, and for example, when the vibration energy of water is added to the predetermined earthquake load by an earthquake load, it can be determined by the strength of an earthquake that may cause deformation, breakage, etc"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3906965-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "furthermore, if the aquarium itself is aged, the tank wall made of concrete may crack due to earthquakes and leak water"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101837911-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, in the case of an immovable settlement caused by an earthquake or the like, there is a problem that the connection between the panels is broken, and leakage occurs in the broken part, thereby losing the function as a water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102297498-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "therefore, the present invention is a useful invention that can prevent water leakage from occurring when the lower portions of the unit panels 22 of the lowermost layer of the water tank body 2 flow outward when an earthquake occurs"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101500632-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "5, a plurality of dampers 10 are formed on a side of the water tank 5 which is in contact with the ground, and a plurality of dampers 10 are installed when a seismic load exceeds a predetermined seismic load, and an earthquake load is transmitted to induce plastic deformation"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101832706-B1", "para_id": "para_22", "text": "for this purpose, it is possible to prevent the structural damage of the waterproof tank top-down resilient dry pad 1 by allowing the base plate 10 to flow during the earthquake through the elongate hole 11"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102101310-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the present invention also has the effect of continuously circulating water as a circulation device is installed to prevent the water swelling inside the water tank when an earthquake occurs.1 is a cross-sectional view of an example of a drainage reservoir having an internal circulation device according to the present invention"}]</data>
