n tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102041291-B1", "para_id": "para_2", "text": "however, only the mechanical devices installed in rainwater pipes or storm water collection tanks do not completely prevent leakage of odors flowing back from the sewage pipes, and as a result, odor leaks around sewage pipes or storm water collection tanks, causing discomfort to passers-by"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100531027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when the rainfall and the level of rainwater and sewage in the sump tank 150 increases, the water level in the guide groove 141 is also increased to raise the lifting height of the buoyancy member 122"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100531031-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, when the rainfall and the level of rainwater and sewage in the sump tank 150 increases, the water level in the guide groove 141 is also increased to raise the lifting height of the buoyancy member 122"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101154026-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "after the manager removes the grating 23 to open the rain gutter 22 and connects the collecting rod to the lifting hook 27a on the ground, the container 27 is lifted to the outside of the rainwater storage tank 20"}, {"pat_id": "US-10865547-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the event of a truly significant rain (storm) event, these storage tanks can be overwhelmed, thus resulting in flooding or discharge of excess storm water to the sewage treatment system, a body of water, or a river"}, {"pat_id": "US-11603651-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in the event of a truly significant rain (storm) event, these storage tanks can be overwhelmed, thus resulting in flooding or discharge of excess storm water to the sewage treatment system, a body of water, or a river"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100877621-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the cover of the sump is characterized in that formed of a transparent body that can identify the inside of the tank.according to the ozone oxidation type wastewater treatment device wh