der connected to the water supply and drain pipe, thereby blocking the air pressure from leaking to the outside through the water supply and drain pipe"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102554668-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "will leak control unit 112 is configured to cause ro pump 450 to stop pumping if empty level switch 350a in tank 350 detects air or a critically low water level"}, {"pat_id": "US-6627073-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "if the water level in the area on the uppermost stream side in the electrolytic tank is controlled in a predetermined range, as in the claim 16, therefore, it is possible to more reliably prevent the water from leaking from the electrolytic tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, the temporary storage tank of chemicals is formed by double walls of the outer wall and the inner wall so that even if the chemical exceeds the inner wall due to the malfunction of the water level control valve, it is protected by the outer wall as well as between the inner wall and the outer wall, that is, the leak detection sensor installed in the safety space"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, the temporary storage tank of chemicals is formed by double walls of the outer wall and the inner wall, so that even if the chemical exceeds the inner wall due to the malfunction of the automatic water level control valve, it is protected by the outer wall, and between the inner wall and the outer wall, that is, a leak detection sensor installed in the safety space"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100985209-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "by estimating the wide water level range, it is possible to increase the reliability of controlling the water level in the water tank, and also, if an error occurs in either the pressure sensor or the angle sensor, such as leakage into the water pipe, the control device does not malfunction by the other"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101676999-B1", "para_id": "para_6", "text"