  <data key="d7">[{"pat_id": "KR-101051656-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "therefore, water is supplied from the water storage container to the spray generator through the water supply valve, and when an appropriate amount of water is supplied to the spray generator, the water level control means rises by buoyancy and blocks the water supply valve so that water is no longer sprayed"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102400040-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in addition, the water level of the treated water tank is measured in real time, and when the water level is out of a certain range, the gate valve is selectively opened and closed to block the flow path of the overflow pipe, thereby increasing the overflow height of the treatment tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200332116-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "at this time, when the water tank level is a high water level, the flow of water is blocked by the float 42 and the pressure valve 43, so that the current of the pump motor increases without being stabilized as shown in fig"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101578433-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "when the water level sensor senses water flowing into the sterilization lamp due to breakage of the sterilization lamp, is configured to actuate the inlet valve to close the inlet tube"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101578433-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "accordingly, when the water level sensor senses water flowing into the sterilizing lamp due to breakage of the sterilizing lamp, the controller 140 operates the inlet valve 150 to close the inlet tube, so as not to be supplied"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100644949-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "water purifier automatic drainage method of another embodiment of the present invention, the water level check step of detecting the water level of the water tank to determine the number of water, the step of determining the number of water to be confirmed for a certain time, and if a predetermined number or more is confirmed, drainage of the water tank and opening the valve and draining the water, determining whether the water level is confirmed within a predetermined time, checking the water level when the water level is confirmed, and draining the water by opening the water drain valve of the water tank"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101569048-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, corrosion and rust- thereby preventing the deterioration of the life of the wiping valve.1 is a longitudinal sectional view of an installation state of a water level shield according to the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100314663-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "and water level (36) (37) is provided, the electronic safety valve (e) automatically discharged to the outside when abnormal pressure to maintain the set pressure and to prevent damage and deformation of the tank ( 39) and automatic air discharge valves 34 and 35 are provided"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100938251-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "the first valve 500 and the second valve 600 are opened or closed at the same time, respectively, and received the displacement measured from the sludge detection unit 700 to determine whether there is deposition, and flows into the interior by the water level sensor 900"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200454214-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "another object of the present invention is to maintain a constant water level using a float valve and to supply a constant concentration of brine to the electrolysis tank so that sodium hypochlorite is equipped with an automatic valve and a flow sensor to produce a constant concentration of sodium hypochlorite it is to provide a generator"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200454214-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "as such, by maintaining the water level at all times using the float valve 131, the suction pressure of saturated brine can be kept constant, and a constant concentration of salt water can be supplied to the electrolysis tank to produce sodium hypochlorite of a constant concentration"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102065694-B1", "para_id": "para_3", "text": "when the water level measured by the water level sensor is less than a certain level in the case of performing the first shut-off valve and open the second on-off valve to prevent the freezing as the sewage of the storage tank is circulated inside can be"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, the temporary storage tank of chemicals is formed by double walls of the outer wall and the inner wall so that even if the chemical exceeds the inner wall due to the malfunction of the water level control valve, it is protected by the outer wall as well as between the inner wall and the outer wall, that is, the leak detection sensor installed in the safety space"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, the temporary storage tank of chemicals is formed by double walls of the outer wall and the inner wall, so that even if the chemical exceeds the inner wall due to the malfunction of the automatic water level control valve, it is protected by the outer wall, and between the inner wall and the outer wall, that is, a leak detection sensor installed in the safety space"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, the temporary storage tank of chemicals is formed by double walls of the outer wall and the inner wall so that even if the chemical exceeds the inner wall due to the malfunction of the water level control valve, it is protected by the outer wall as well as between the inner wall and the outer wall, that is, the leak detection sensor installed in the safety space"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100932027-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "in particular, the temporary storage tank of chemicals is formed by double walls of the outer wall and the inner wall, so that even if the chemical exceeds the inner wall due to the malfunction of the automatic water level control valve, it is protected by the outer wall, and between the inner wall and the outer wall, that is, a leak detection sensor installed in the safety space"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100323046-B1", "para_id": "claim_1", "text": "and the venturi pipe (6) through the rubber ring 23 on the upper and lower outer surfaces to prevent leakage of chemicals, the venturi pipe (6) the valve 13 is located on the lower inner inclined surface, and the lock nut 15 and the vertical float 24 are coupled to the lower end of the valve shaft 14 to finely adjust to correspond to the water level of the chemical 30"}, {"pat_id": "KR-102149596-B1", "para_id": "para_4", "text": "the emergency monitoring terminal (120b) is operated by receiving power from the emergency storage battery (20), and information such as whether the valve is opened or closed, flow rate, hydraulic pressure, water level in each reservoir, leakage, etc"}, {"pat_id": "KR-100472567-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "accordingly, when the water level of the sewage pit 5 reaches a predetermined height while the collection tank 21 and the vacuum line 9 are maintained in a vacuum state by operating the vacuum pump 23, the vacuum valve controller 17 ) opens the vacuum valve 13 so that the sewage in the sewage pit 5 is sucked into the collection tank 21 of the vacuum pumping station 7 along the vacuum line 9"}, {"pat_id": "KR-200371175-Y1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "accordingly, when the water level of the sewage pit 5 reaches a predetermined height while the collection tank 21 and the vacuum line 9 are maintained in a vacuum state by operating the vacuum pump 23, the vacuum valve controller 17 ) opens the vacuum valve 13 so that the sewage in the sewage pit 5 is sucked into the collection tank 21 of the vacuum pumping station 7 along the vacuum line 9"}, {"pat_id": "US-7013909-B2", "para_id": "para_38", "text": "when the water level of sewage in the sewage pit 1 increases and the pressure in the pressure sensor pipe 2 increases, the pressure is transmitted via the pipe 33 to the first chamber 17 of the vacuum valve controller 100"}, {"pat_id": "US-8074670-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "additionally, when the water level within the porosity reservoir 30 drops below the static level 52 (so qout equals zero and the reservoir transitions from dynamic storage to static storage), the valve 104 is completely closed to set qin equal to zero and prevent the groundwater interceptor 96 from inadvertently filling the reservoir 30"}, {"pat_id": "KR-101569048-B1", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "thus, corrosion and rust- thereby preventing the deterioration of the life of the wiping valve.1 is a longitudinal sectional view of an installation state of a water level shield according to the present invention"}, {"pat_id": "JP-3347959-B2", "para_id": "para_1", "text": "[0003] in a vacuum valve unit of this type of vacuum type sewer system, when a sewage water level abnormality of a sewage tank occurs due to a vacuum valve failure or the like, it is necessary to quickly detect this and notify a manager"}]</data>
